<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 6.86 pct on Swedish bond auction.</title>
<headline>Average rate 6.86 pct on Swedish bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.0 billion crowns of 10-year bonds was 6.86 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1037</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		2.0</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)		2.42</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		 47</p>
<p> Number of bids			    54</p>
<p> Lowest yield				6.840</p>
<p> Highest yield			     6.879</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		  6.859</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
